# experiment: jvt-e9-jcmd-lock-owner (jcmd 덤프가 Virtual Thread 의 락 소유자를 찍는가)
# java: openjdk version "26.0.2.1" 2026-08-18 / openjdk version "25.0.4.1" 2026-08-18 LTS
# command: java LockDump.java & ; jcmd <pid> Thread.dump_to_file -overwrite td.txt

